WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.665
Lab 2 needs a test tenant with the
Microsoft profile on for a pilot group,

2
00:00:04.665 --> 00:00:09.750
a test device, an emergency access group,
and a second test tenant as the partner.

3
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.737
Find the two Intune apps and
put their IDs in the settings.

4
00:00:13.737 --> 00:00:18.176
Collect, plan and apply the report-only
policy with the approved hash.

5
00:00:18.176 --> 00:00:23.251
Run Learn's test: sign in, disable the
client, open a new browser session,

6
00:00:23.251 --> 00:00:27.437
and sign in again; in report-only,
that's a recorded failure.

7
00:00:27.437 --> 00:00:32.038
Read the tenant restrictions policy,
and stop if its default doesn't block.

8
00:00:32.038 --> 00:00:33.826
Run Learn's four-case test.

9
00:00:33.826 --> 00:00:36.362
Then back it out: delete the lab's policy,

10
00:00:36.362 --> 00:00:39.137
and turn tagging off if
the lab turned it on.

11
00:00:39.137 --> 00:00:41.210
The authors haven't run this lab.
